        "fr-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "a132919e-d2d2-3f11-a9b2-3cf49b652aee",
                "word": "propension",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "d67f5f3e-f209-4d1b-8699-5d81ec25e477",
                        "entry_id": "a132919e-d2d2-3f11-a9b2-3cf49b652aee",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "propensions"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "05d085b0-619a-3b26-b5a1-0c6228dccf0c",
                        "entry_id": "a132919e-d2d2-3f11-a9b2-3cf49b652aee",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Tendance naturelle vers un état, une action ; penchant ; inclination."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c2a3623c-e92f-453d-aeed-f236dbed6f1d",
                                "sense_id": "05d085b0-619a-3b26-b5a1-0c6228dccf0c",
                                "text": "[…] j’essayais de réagir contre la propension de la finance française à orienter trop exclusivement notre épargne vers les placements à l’extérieur, surtout vers l’achat des fonds d’État étrangers."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "dc4e4ab0-bf59-4997-aa9f-d910c5a9d8db",
                                "sense_id": "05d085b0-619a-3b26-b5a1-0c6228dccf0c",
                                "text": "[…] je ne trouvai rien à redire hormis le fait qu’il avait le teint bistré et une propension à la pilosité, deux traits qui me déplurent."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "751980b2-dd01-4cdb-aed9-96f7b0d75e24",
                                "sense_id": "05d085b0-619a-3b26-b5a1-0c6228dccf0c",
                                "text": "Deuxième corollaire : la quakerisation des mœurs en progression géométrique accentue une propension halloweenesque à détecter le monstre parmi nous."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1033e63c-987c-4a73-bc37-860bc5fa0e24",
                                "sense_id": "05d085b0-619a-3b26-b5a1-0c6228dccf0c",
                                "text": "Elle était envoyée chez le proviseur presque aussi souvent que Dan Swansea, à cause de sa propension à siffler des imprécations du genre : « Tu mourras en enfer, sodomite » aux filles qui roulaient des patins à leurs copains dans les couloirs."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "69ff27db-91bb-4152-a08c-358beadab2a7",
                                "sense_id": "05d085b0-619a-3b26-b5a1-0c6228dccf0c",
                                "text": "Il reste une redoutable propension de l’architecte à penser la cité radieuse et à produire des Alphaville criminogènes."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "67b7a880-8d87-4274-b35a-5bac36f797fc",
                        "source_entry_id": "a132919e-d2d2-3f11-a9b2-3cf49b652aee",
                        "source_sense_id": "05d085b0-619a-3b26-b5a1-0c6228dccf0c",
                        "target_lang_word": "propensity",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "propensity",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ca0db8e2-8ec0-3078-a251-ccbce4a3a27a",
                                        "entry_id": "1c2df5c9-3b9c-39cd-91c0-801fe13f60a5",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An inclination, disposition, tendency, preference, or attraction."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2c217d89-c4af-45c9-83f3-83aec6b09193",
                                                "sense_id": "ca0db8e2-8ec0-3078-a251-ccbce4a3a27a",
                                                "text": "He has a propensity for lengthy discussions of certain favorite topics."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0fd241f2-d618-422a-8e96-d359c3a27156",
                                                "sense_id": "ca0db8e2-8ec0-3078-a251-ccbce4a3a27a",
                                                "text": "I must own they do dearly delight in a judgment; and sorry am I that I cannot gratify this laudable propensity by specifying some peculiar evil incurred by Mr. Delawarr's ambition, or Lady Etheringhame's vanity."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "03daa579-e30e-44a8-a3e9-859aa730f970",
                                                "sense_id": "ca0db8e2-8ec0-3078-a251-ccbce4a3a27a",
                                                "text": "To the psychologist the religious propensities of man must be at least as interesting as any other of the facts pertaining to his mental constitution. It would seem, therefore, that, as a psychologist, the natural thing for me would be to invite you to a descriptive survey of those religious propensities."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8db24836-5105-41a4-b263-c8c426d5317a",
                                                "sense_id": "ca0db8e2-8ec0-3078-a251-ccbce4a3a27a",
                                                "text": "Here their peculiar propensities manifest themselves in making shibboleths of abstractions, in rationalizing and carrying to extremes certain ambitions which spring from the normal intercourse of men."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "93ad7e6a-1e2f-43f6-b232-00da27cf3888",
                                                "sense_id": "ca0db8e2-8ec0-3078-a251-ccbce4a3a27a",
                                                "text": "He had a tremendous propensity for getting lost when driving."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "deb52e2d-07d2-4cc7-b643-d09d6917d4b8",
                                                "sense_id": "ca0db8e2-8ec0-3078-a251-ccbce4a3a27a",
                                                "text": "Bats host many high-profile viruses that can infect humans, including severe acute respiratory syndrome and Ebola. A recent study explored the ecological variables that may contribute to bats’ propensity to harbor such zoonotic diseases by comparing them with another order of common reservoir hosts: rodents."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "2b09c3da-df41-4772-b8fc-1cb958945043",
                        "source_entry_id": "a132919e-d2d2-3f11-a9b2-3cf49b652aee",
                        "source_sense_id": "05d085b0-619a-3b26-b5a1-0c6228dccf0c",
                        "target_lang_word": "propensione",
                        "target_lang_code": "it",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "propensione",
